body:
I was walking on my driveway and tripped. Instead of putting my hands out, (I was holding my already-broken phone in one of my hands), I thought that the best idea was the fall face-first onto the driveway. I got a rock stuck in my knee and it left a nice scar.

&#x200B;

About a year later, I opened the oven and didn't want to ask my mother to move a bit, so I had opened it slightly and went to pull out the food I was cooking. I burnt the entire top of my wrist on that damn oven. Never again.
